        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Banjo Pilot is a kart-style racing game which was originally slated to become \"Diddy Kong Pilot.\" It features at least eight characters from the Banjo-Kazooie series, each with its own aircraft and storyline, including Banjo, Mumbo Jumbo, Humba Wumba, Guntilda, Klungo, Jolly Roger and Kazooie. The game includes link cable support for up to four players.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Banjo-Pilot es un juego de carreras estilo kart que originalmente iba a llamarse \"Diddy Kong Pilot\". Incluye al menos ocho personajes de la serie Banjo-Kazooie, cada uno con su propia aeronave e historia, entre ellos Banjo, Mumbo Jumbo, Humba Wumba, Guntilda, Klungo, Jolly Roger y Kazooie. El juego admite cable link para hasta cuatro jugadores.",
